@startuml
title LangGraph nodes and deterministic routing
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Host identity; session ownership;\nrate limit; session lock; global capacity;
if (Admitted?) then (yes)
  :input_rules;
  if (Rules pass?) then (yes)
    :load_context;
    note right
      Exact owner; same-tenant explicit document readers.
      Omit whole records to fit the context budget.
    end note
    :input_judge;
    if (Typed observations satisfy policy?) then (yes)
      :generate;
      :output_rules;
      if (Output checks pass?) then (yes)
        :output_judge;
        if (Safety and quality pass?) then (yes)
          :commit;
          :Release candidate;
        else (no)
          :Discard draft; static fallback;
        endif
      else (no)
        :Discard draft; static fallback;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Neutral greeting for name-only uncertainty;\notherwise static fallback; no memory write;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Neutral greeting for unsuitable name;\notherwise static blocked response;
  endif
else (no)
  :Static unavailable response;
endif
:Release capacity; metadata audit;
stop
legend bottom
Provider errors, timeouts and invalid schemas fail closed.
No graph loops, model-selected routes, automated revision or tool dispatch.
Screened memory remains untrusted data.
endlegend
@enduml
